<BaseLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility information and barrier-reporting contact for the Lowcountry Digital Works website.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container readable"><p class="eyebrow">Accessibility</p><h1>Accessibility Statement</h1><p class="lede">Lowcountry Digital Works wants this website to be usable by as many people as practical, including people with disabilities.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container readable">
<h2>Our approach</h2>
<p>Accessibility is part of LDW's normal website design and review process. The website engineering standard targets WCAG 2.2 Level AA where applicable and includes practices such as semantic structure, keyboard-operable interactions, visible focus, readable contrast, text alternatives, responsive reflow, and reduced-motion support.</p>
<p>LDW uses automated and manual checks as part of website review. Automated testing cannot identify every accessibility barrier, and browsers, assistive technologies, third-party services, and web content can change over time. This statement is not a guarantee that every page or third-party destination will be free of accessibility barriers.</p>

<h2>If you encounter a barrier</h2>
<p>If something on this website is difficult to access or use, please contact LDW and, if practical, tell us the page or feature you were trying to use and the problem you encountered.</p>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:eddie@lowcountrydigitalworks.com">eddie@lowcountrydigitalworks.com</a><br />Phone: <a href="tel:+18436333123">843-633-3123</a></p>
<p>LDW will make a reasonable effort to understand the issue and provide the information or service in an accessible alternative when practical.</p>

<h2>Third-party services</h2>
<p>Some links may take you to websites or services operated by other organizations. LDW does not control the accessibility of third-party services, but considers accessibility when selecting and integrating services where practical.</p>

<p><em>Last updated: October 1, 2026.</em></p>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
